dinal":277191,"en":"If the man is your brother"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l017","ordinal":277192,"en":"Don't knock the bird,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l018","ordinal":277193,"en":"Without whipping,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l019","ordinal":277194,"en":"Not limited to beak,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l020","ordinal":277195,"en":"Without stepping on the bar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l021","ordinal":277196,"en":"Don't get old,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l022","ordinal":277197,"en":"Again my brother, look at me!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l023","ordinal":277198,"en":"If you don't take care of it, it's a shame."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l024","ordinal":277199,"en":"Bad letter, young children"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l025","ordinal":277200,"en":"Kulchorom, a deposit for you!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l026","ordinal":277201,"en":"If I see it, I'll be satisfied."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l027","ordinal":277202,"en":"If you look at it, your stomach is full."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l028","ordinal":277203,"en":"If I imagine, Urmekem -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l029","ordinal":277204,"en":"White grandmother is my mother."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l030","ordinal":277205,"en":"An old man who has seen his full years -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l031","ordinal":277206,"en":"My mother is a saint,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l032","ordinal":277207,"en":"Let him see the doomsday,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l033","ordinal":277208,"en":"Do not fear the soul"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l034","ordinal":277209,"en":"Even if it shines, if it eats poison,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l035","ordinal":277210,"en":"My grandmother died"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l036","ordinal":277211,"en":"Let the trail die!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l037","ordinal":277212,"en":"Until the setting of the five-pointed star"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l038","ordinal":277213,"en":"Five turned back and nursed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b003:l039","ordinal":277214,"en":"He chewed and ate from the goat."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l001","ordinal":277215,"en":"Expanding the narrow belly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l002","ordinal":277216,"en":"Stone released her breast."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l003","ordinal":277217,"en":"Don't get into trouble,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l004","ordinal":277218,"en":"Shame on death"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l005","ordinal":277219,"en":"Doubt in the stomach"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l006","ordinal":277220,"en":"Semetei is called a descendant."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l007","ordinal":277221,"en":"That's the wish."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l008","ordinal":277222,"en":"It's a shame if it really burns -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l009","ordinal":277223,"en":"Savings to Aichuruk!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l010","ordinal":277224,"en":"If the man is safe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l011","ordinal":277225,"en":"From adulthood to manhood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l012","ordinal":277226,"en":"A man will be equal to his son,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l013","ordinal":277227,"en":"There will be a shock from the universe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l014","ordinal":277228,"en":"Atakkan stops,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l015","ordinal":277229,"en":"Have a full feast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l016","ordinal":277230,"en":"If the man is the child"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l017","ordinal":277231,"en":"Name it \"Seitek\"!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l018","ordinal":277232,"en":"A trap in the heart"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l019","ordinal":277233,"en":"Leave it all"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l020","ordinal":277234,"en":"If it is not a man, but a girl"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l021","ordinal":277235,"en":"Give the name you know."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l022","ordinal":277236,"en":"Be wise,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l023","ordinal":277237,"en":"Get used to this saying"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l024","ordinal":277238,"en":"Give a place where you don't cry!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l025","ordinal":277239,"en":"Is the dead not dead?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l026","ordinal":277240,"en":"The rest will not see the day?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l027","ordinal":277241,"en":"Grieving and complaining"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l028","ordinal":277242,"en":"Do not swallow the anger of trouble"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l029","ordinal":277243,"en":"Kairan letter Aichüruk"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l030","ordinal":277244,"en":"The murderer said that"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l031","ordinal":277245,"en":"Don't let the moon tear your face."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l032","ordinal":277246,"en":"If he is sad, he will be insulted"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l033","ordinal":277247,"en":"My word is a deposit,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1189:b004:l034","ordinal":277248,"en":"Cross the required letter"}]
